Much like the [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Royal_Guard_1 Royal] [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Royal_Guard_2 Guards], Dogamy changed alongside [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Dogaressa Dogaressa]. Starting with 7G, he was reduced to 6G in '''Alpha 2.1''', and reduced further to 5G in '''Beta 2.6'''.

'''Beta 6.2''' dropped his HP from 8 to 7, and his Magic, which made him gain +5 ATK if you had an ally Dogaressa, was dropped to give him +4. This means that after the effect, his stats will be 7/7 instead of 8/8. '''Beta 15.0''' nerfed his ability further by only giving +3 ATK, and '''Beta 20.0''' nerfed his HP to 6, making him max out at 6/6.

'''Beta 41.0''' reworked the card engine, which allowed 'aura' effects to work. This resulted in him getting reworked to passively gain +2 ATK as long as you have a Dogaressa in your hand. '''Beta 56.0''' gave him +1 ATK, but changed his aura into a dust that gave +4 ATK randomly split among all Dogs in your hand.

